data/AlphaEarth_experiments_full_data.csv
data/alphaearth_user_interactions.csv
data/prod_alphaearth_user_interactions.csv
data/*.csv
```

This tells Vercel to ignore these files during deployment. Your production app only needs `statistics.json` (which gets downloaded via the prebuild script), not the original CSV files.

**Also check your `.gitignore`:**

Make sure these CSVs aren't being tracked by git either:
```
# Add to .gitignore if not already there
data/*.csv
data/AlphaEarth_experiments_full_data.csv
data/alphaearth_user_interactions.csv
data/prod_alphaearth_user_interactions.csv